  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: Everything is getting more expensive. I feel like my paycheck is shrinking
      while the workload is growing.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "Tell me about it. I\u2019m pedaling twice as fast just to stay in the
      same place financially."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: "It\u2019s a struggle, kid. But hey, as long as we\u2019re still working,
      we\u2019re still winning, right?"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Winning a very exhausting race, maybe.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: Haha! Better than not being in the race at all. Stay strong!
